        <b>How to play:</b> read the order tickets on the left, cook patties on the
        <b>grill</b> (6s) and fries in the <b>fryer</b> (8s) &mdash; take them off in time or they burn!
        Stack the right ingredients on your plate, then <b>SERVE</b>. Fast serves earn bigger tips.
        A wrong dish costs $5 and breaks your streak.
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <span>KEYS <b>1&ndash;8</b> add ingredients</span><span><b>SPACE</b> serve</span><span><b>R</b> restart shift</span>
    <span>Golden Wok Bistro &middot; a complete cooking game &middot; offline, keyboard + mouse</span>
  </footer>

  <div class="toast" id="toast"></div>

  <!-- START -->
