    <div class="card">
      <h1>GOLDEN <span class="gold">WOK</span> BISTRO</h1>
      <p>Welcome to the busiest little bistro in town. Orders are flying in &mdash;
      grill the patties, fry the fries, stack the burgers and serve them hot before the tickets expire.</p>
      <div class="menu">
        <span class="chip">8 ingredient stations</span><span class="chip">Live order board</span>
        <span class="chip">Grill &amp; fryer timers</span><span class="chip">Tips for fast serves</span>
